[9.788956, "o", "--- BAY_NOTES ---\r\n"]
[9.79137, "o", "Kiln CLI lives at /app/bin/kilncli.\r\n\r\nSubcommands:\r\n  impress PATH  apply every *.sql under /app/inkstack/migrations/ onto PATH\r\n  spill         fill /app/vats/worker.vat for assay\r\n  assay         read /app/vats/worker.vat, print schema_version, write /app/vats/assay.ok on success\r\n\r\nThe Makefile at /app/Makefile ships /app/bin/kilncli from the kilncli module.\r\n\r\nSources that implement those subcommands:\r\n  /app/hopsrc/imprint\r\n  /app/claybin\r\n  /app/scorepit\r\n\r\nLedger intent: /app/inkstack/intent.toml\r\nWorkspace vat path used by local experiments: /app/hearth/focus.txt\r\n"]
